{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016133209118-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016162447\"/><p>紅磡有人墮樓亡。今午(16日)1時03分，一名女子報案指其姓黃(29歲)女兒，企圖在海逸道8號輕生。救援人員接報到場前，黃女已從高處墮下倒臥平台，救護員經檢驗後，證實她已當場身亡。警員經初步調查，相信黃女從一單位墮下，於現場沒有檢獲遺書，不排除她因感情及愭緒問題輕生。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:39:56.997987+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:32:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:18:06.752838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:37:58.015769+00:00","content_hash":"64e9543a0527306157dac34e973b26100637d76c77c53da1ea12459983216cd8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}